Zenith's staff is composed of fourteen professionals, of whom eight lawyers, three fiscal advisers and
three professional accountants with expertise in recovery procedures and a dedicated staff of twelve
additional professionals has been created to cover accounting, reporting, EDP and legal tasks
associated with the Securitisation.

