       and unsubordinated debt obligations of which are rated at least "Aa3" by Moody's and "AA-"
       by S&P.

       "Collection Account" means a euro-denominated bank account into which all amounts paid
       by the Region and/or the Health Authorities under the Delegations of Payment and/or under
       the Settlement Agreements and/or under the Contracts will be credited;

       "Collection Date" means the sixth Business Day preceding each Interest Payment Date;




