The Prospectus will be available to the public during usual business hours at the registered offices of
the Listing and Luxembourg Paying Agent and will be published on the Luxembourg Stock Exchange
website (www.bourse.lu).

Notes freely transferable

According to Chapter XII, article 4, point B/1 of the "Rules and Regulations of the Luxembourg Stock
Exchange", the Notes shall be freely transferable and therefore no transaction made on the
Luxembourg Stock Exchange shall be cancelled.

Post-issuance transaction information

The Issuer will not provide the investors with any post-issuance transaction information with respect
to the performance of the Claims, apart from the Investor Report.



